WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.142
These opening cards name roles and purpose, version and effective point. A

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:08.283
usable agreement connects its sections rather than listing unlimited duties. Record when

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.425
the arrangement takes effect.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.125
The three cards separate arranging, approving and paying. Each needs its actual

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:21.583
permission and conditions. Communication and privacy controls also identify appropriate channels and

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:26.042
the minimum information needed.

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:30.292
Explore all twelve worked clauses, including cover, concerns, confirmation and review. The

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:34.317
blank tool groups them into eleven areas; do not lose a clause

00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:38.342
simply because the headings differ.
